- remote page retains a minimum width and chrome degrades before content geometry is violated;
- vertical context rows bind tabs to actual Fleet agent role/lifecycle/generation/transport proof when exposed;
- exact-bound `supervisor.current_command.payload.tab_id` can surface `ACTION · <typed action>` on that tab; no URL/platform heuristic can invent an action indicator;
- Operations surfaces Fleet, Supervisor, watchdog, mesh, Worker Observer, DevOS cycle/recovery/transport fencing, Self-Update/continuity, Development Plane, Compute, Downloads and Owner Safety Gates;
- missing evidence renders UNKNOWN; source-only Browser Sentinel / Host Resilience / Parent Progress Lease remain explicitly NOT EXPOSED;
- Operations is read-only: no gate mutation, Fleet reconcile/profile mutation, SET_MODE/ARM, semantic page actuation or download mutation controls;
- untrusted runtime/page strings render through textContent / constructed DOM only; strict self-only CSP is preserved;
- no arbitrary eval or shell authority added.

